---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contact — Sustainabox | Book a Stay or Schedule a Call" description="Get in touch with Jen and Cody at Sustainabox. Book your weekend stay, schedule a free consulting call, or ask about courses and digital tools.">

	<header class="page-hero" style="background-image: url('/images/deck.jpeg');">
		<div class="page-hero-inner">
			<span class="eyebrow">Contact</span>
			<h1>Get in Touch</h1>
			<p>Questions about a stay, the walkthrough, or your own build? We'd love to hear from you.</p>
		</div>
	</header>

	<!-- Contact Cards -->
	<section class="container content-section">
		<div class="section-head">
			<span class="eyebrow">Reach Out</span>
			<h2>How Can We Help?</h2>
			<p>Pick the option that fits — we respond to all inquiries within 24 hours.</p>
		</div>

		<div class="contact-grid">
			<div class="contact-card">
				<div class="contact-card-icon">🏠</div>
				<h3>Book a Stay</h3>
				<p>Ready to spend a weekend at Sustainabox? Share your preferred dates and group size and we'll get you set up.</p>
				<a href="mailto:jenswid@gmail.com,codyswid@gmail.com?subject=Sustainabox%20Stay%20Inquiry" class="btn btn-primary">Email to Book</a>
			</div>

			<div class="contact-card">
				<div class="contact-card-icon">📐</div>
				<h3>Consulting & Design</h3>
				<p>Planning your own container home or alternative build? We offer design review, planning packages, and ongoing support.</p>
				<a href="mailto:jenswid@gmail.com,codyswid@gmail.com?subject=Sustainabox%20Consulting%20Inquiry" class="btn btn-primary">Start a Conversation</a>
			</div>

			<div class="contact-card">
				<div class="contact-card-icon">🎓</div>
				<h3>Course & Tools</h3>
				<p>Questions about the 4-hour walkthrough, digital templates, or anything else we offer? We're happy to help.</p>
				<a href="mailto:jenswid@gmail.com,codyswid@gmail.com?subject=Sustainabox%20Course%20Inquiry" class="btn btn-primary">Ask Us Anything</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<p class="response-note">We respond within 24 hours. Coming soon: <em>hello@sustainabox.org</em></p>
	</section>

	<!-- Meet the Team -->
	<section class="team-section">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="section-head">
				<span class="eyebrow">Who You're Talking To</span>
				<h2>Meet Jen & Cody</h2>
			</div>

			<div class="team-grid">
				<div class="team-card">
					<!-- JEN: Replace this placeholder with your headshot photo -->
					<div class="team-photo team-photo-placeholder">
						<span>JS</span>
					</div>
					<div class="team-info">
						<h3>Jen Swidler</h3>
						<span class="team-role">General Contractor & Builder</span>
						<p>Seven years of hands-on homebuilding and general contracting. Jen designed and led the Sustainabox build from foundation to finishes — she knows every system, every decision, and every tradeoff firsthand.</p>
						<p>She leads all stay experiences and in-person walkthroughs.</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="team-card">
					<div class="team-photo team-photo-placeholder">
						<span>CS</span>
					</div>
					<div class="team-info">
						<h3>Cody Swidler</h3>
						<span class="team-role">Enterprise Resilience & Risk</span>
						<p>15+ years in enterprise risk, operational resilience, and security across global fintech, SaaS, and tech companies. Cody brings systems thinking and resilience design principles to every aspect of the build.</p>
						<p>He leads consulting engagements and the risk/resilience curriculum.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- FAQ -->
	<section class="container faq-section">
		<div class="section-head">
			<span class="eyebrow">Common Questions</span>
			<h2>Before You Reach Out</h2>
		</div>

		<div class="faq-grid">
			<div class="faq-item">
				<h4>How do I book a stay?</h4>
				<p>Email us with your preferred dates and group size. We'll confirm availability, share details, and collect a deposit via Venmo to hold your dates.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="faq-item">
				<h4>Is the walkthrough always included?</h4>
				<p>Yes — either in-person with Jen when we're on-site, or via the 4-hour recorded video walkthrough with projector setup when we're traveling.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="faq-item">
				<h4>How many guests can you host?</h4>
				<p>Comfortably 2–4 guests. The property can accommodate up to 6 for group stays — reach out to discuss options.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="faq-item">
				<h4>Is it actually off-grid?</h4>
				<p>No — Sustainabox is grid-connected (water, septic, electric) but designed with resilience principles. Think of it as infrastructure-ready with self-sufficiency in mind.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="faq-item">
				<h4>Can I bring my own build plans to review?</h4>
				<p>Absolutely. Many guests come with specific questions about their own projects. Bring drawings, photos, or questions and we'll work through them together.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="faq-item">
				<h4>Do you offer consulting without a stay?</h4>
				<p>Yes. We offer remote design review, planning packages, and ongoing support — no travel required. See the <a href="/offerings">Offerings page</a> for details.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

</Layout>

<style>
	.content-section {
		padding: 5rem 0 3rem;
	}

	.contact-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.contact-card {
		background: white;
		border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
		border-top: 3px solid var(--color-blue);
		padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
		border-radius: 4px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.contact-card-icon {
		font-size: 1.75rem;
	}

	.contact-card h3 {
		color: var(--color-navy);
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.contact-card p {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		flex-grow: 1;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.contact-card .btn {
		align-self: flex-start;
	}

	.response-note {
		text-align: center;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
	}

	/* Team */
	.team-section {
		padding: 5rem 0;
		background: var(--color-warm);
	}

	.team-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr));
		gap: 3rem;
	}

	.team-card {
		display: flex;
		gap: 2rem;
		align-items: flex-start;
	}

	.team-photo {
		width: 120px;
		height: 120px;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: 4px;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.team-photo-placeholder {
		width: 120px;
		height: 120px;
		background: var(--color-navy);
		border-radius: 4px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		flex-shrink: 0;
		color: white;
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.team-info h3 {
		color: var(--color-navy);
		margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
	}

	.team-role {
		display: block;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--color-blue);
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}

	.team-info p {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	/* Location */
	.location-section {
		padding: 5rem 0;
		background: white;
	}

	.location-inner {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 4rem;
		align-items: center;
	}

	.location-text h2 {
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.location-text > p {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.location-details {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
	}

	.location-details li {
		padding: 0.5rem 0;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
		position: relative;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;
	}

	.location-details li:last-child {
		border-bottom: none;
	}

	.location-details li::before {
		content: "→";
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		color: var(--color-blue);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.location-image img {
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
		object-fit: cover;
		border-radius: 4px;
	}

	/* FAQ */
	.faq-section {
		padding: 5rem 0;
	}

	.faq-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.faq-item {
		padding: 1.5rem 0 1.5rem 1.5rem;
		border-left: 3px solid var(--color-blue);
	}

	.faq-item h4 {
		color: var(--color-navy);
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	.faq-item p {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.faq-item a {
		color: var(--color-blue);
	}

	/* Mobile */
	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.team-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.team-card {
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 1.5rem;
		}

		.location-inner {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 2rem;
		}

		.location-image {
			order: -1;
		}

		.faq-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.contact-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
